<h1 class="mb-3">About Me</h1>

<div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <p class="lead">Hi, I'm <strong>Krish Sah</strong> &mdash; the developer behind GameVault.</p>
        <p>
            I'm a college student double majoring in <strong>Software Development</strong> and <strong>Data Technology</strong>,
            graduating in 2028. I love building things &mdash; apps, tools and side projects &mdash; and this site combines two things I enjoy:
            programming and video games.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h4 mt-4">What I used to build this site</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>ASP.NET Core MVC (controllers, Razor views, shared layout)</li>
            <li>Entity Framework Core with SQL Server LocalDB and code-first migrations</li>
            <li>Dependency injection for the <code>DbContext</code></li>
            <li>Bootstrap 5 and jQuery for the interface</li>
            <li>Git and GitHub for version control (feature branches merged into <code>main</code>)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

